OL,3,GNEWSAMy busy life meant I delayed my
OL,4,Asmear test - then I got cancer
OL,5,
OL,6,FAt the age of 30, Laura Woods was
OL,7,Fliving a busy life, raising her
OL,8,Fdaughter and working full-time.
OL,10,FWhen an NHS reminder letter arrived
OL,11,Fabout her smear test, she ignored it.
OL,13,FBut a few months later, when she found
OL,14,Ftime to book the test, doctors found a
OL,15,F5.5cm tumour and diagnosed her with
OL,16,Fcervical cancer.
OL,18,FEverything she valued in her life felt
OL,19,F"smashed" to pieces, she says.
